  "slug": "civic",
  "name": "Civic",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Connect Claude Code to Civic for guardrails, scoped permissions, audit trails, and revocable access control. Every tool call is logged, permissions are user-controlled, and access can be revoked instantly.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 MCP server**, `civic`.\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install civic@claude-community` from `civicteam/civic-mcp-gateway`.\n\nConnecting AI Agents to tools and data via the Civic MCP Gateway gives builders access to guardrails, scoped permissions, audit trails, and revocable access when calling MCP tools. Civic separates the permission layer from the AI agent so they can't get around restrictions.",
